/**
 * @defgroup api_libraries Libraries
 * @brief Reusable libraries that know nothing about R-Type.
 *
 * They live under `lib/` and could drive another game.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup api_engine Game engine
 * @ingroup api_libraries
 * @brief Main loop, ECS components and systems, scenes, event bus, entity
 * factory, input mapping and backend concepts (`lib/GameEngine`).
 *
 * See @ref engine for an overview.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup api_network Network library
 * @ingroup api_libraries
 * @brief UDP transport, packet and message framing, sequence tracking and
 * connection management (`lib/Network`).
 *
 * See @ref networking for an overview.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup api_game R-Type game
 * @brief Code specific to R-Type, built on top of the libraries.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup api_protocol Protocol payloads
 * @ingroup api_game
 * @brief Message types, payload layouts and value encodings shared by the
 * client and the server (`src/Common/Protocol`).
 *
 * See @ref protocol for the full specification.
 */

/**
 * @defgroup api_gameplay Shared gameplay
 * @ingroup api_game
 * @brief Gameplay components and systems used by both programs
 * (`src/Common`).
 */

/**
 * @defgroup api_client Client
 * @ingroup api_game
 * @brief The `r-type_client` program: scenes, inputs, network client and
 * backend adapters (`src/Client`).
 */

/**
 * @defgroup api_server Server
 * @ingroup api_game
 * @brief The `r-type_server` program: authoritative simulation, scenes and
 * message handling (`src/Server`).
 */
